<span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Dear customer,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight about our baggage freight services. </span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Qantas Freight can send unaccompanied baggage from most Australia-based major airports to a number of overseas destinations provided the person lodging the freight also has proof of intended travel in their name. </span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">The port of origin and/or the description of unaccompanied baggage that you have provided cannot be accepted for this service.<br />
<br />
The following can be sent as unaccompanied baggage. </span></span>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Personal clothing</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Books</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Musical instruments</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Sporting goods</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">&nbsp;Household items (no electrical equipment)</span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Laptop computers, portable radios, portable stereo systems and tools of trade (excluding power tools) are also acceptable provided your baggage is only travelling on Qantas aircraft and between Qantas serviced airports. (This does not include code-share services with partner airlines).<br />
&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<span style="font-family:times new roman,serif;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">We would advise you to make contact with a customs licenced freight forwarding company to assist you further. We are unable to recommend a particular company but you will find many on any internet search engine.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
It is recommended that you obtain several quotes as you may find prices and services will vary greatly between companies.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We are sorry that we are not able to assist you directly and wish you the best of luck with this matter.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Kind Regards,<br />
